# The on-device speech engine, built from source; this fork ships no
# prebuilt speech binaries. The pinned commit lives in the superproject
# index (git submodule status shows it) and follows an upstream release
# tag. Vetted before adoption: MIT license (engine and models), active
# upstream, current stable tag, and the CMake build in whisper-native
# disables every network, server, and example surface so only the core
# library is compiled in.
[submodule "whisper-native/src/main/cpp/whisper.cpp"]
	path = whisper-native/src/main/cpp/whisper.cpp
	url = https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp.git
